1: # Plugin Testing Guide
2: 
3: ## Overview
4: 
5: Flutter plugins require special testing strategies because they include native code. This guide covers testing plugin packages with Dart, native, and integration tests.
6: 
7: ## Test Types for Plugins
8: 
9: | Type           | Tests                      | Runs On         | Purpose                           |
10: |----------------|---------------------------|------------------|-----------------------------------|
11: | Dart Unit      | Single classes/functions  | Dart VM        | Test Dart code in isolation       |
12: | Dart Widget     | UI components             | Test environment | Test widget behavior              |
13: | Dart Integration | Dart + Native bridge     | Device/Emulator | Test full plugin functionality    |
14: | Native Unit     | Native code              | Native test env | Test native code in isolation     |
15: | Native UI       | Native UI + Flutter UI  | Device/Emulator | Test native UI interactions       |
16: 
17: ## Project Structure
18: 
19: ```
20: my_plugin/
21: ├── lib/                    # Dart code
22: │   └── my_plugin.dart
23: ├── android/                 # Android native code
24: │   └── src/test/           # Android unit tests
25: ├── ios/                    # iOS native code
26: ├── example/                 # Example app
27: │   ├── integration_test/      # Integration tests
28: │   ├── ios/RunnerTests/     # iOS tests
29: │   └── lib/
30: ├── test/                    # Dart unit tests
31: │   └── my_plugin_test.dart
32: └── pubspec.yaml
33: ```
34: 
35: ## Dart Unit Tests
36: 
37: ### Basic Plugin Unit Test
38: 
39: ```dart
40: import 'package:flutter_test/flutter_test.dart';
41: import 'package:my_plugin/my_plugin.dart';
42: 
43: void main() {
44:   test('plugin initializes correctly', () {
45:     final plugin = MyPlugin();
46:     expect(plugin.initialized, false);
47:     
48:     plugin.initialize();
49:     expect(plugin.initialized, true);
50:   });
51:   
52:   test('processes data correctly', () {
53:     final plugin = MyPlugin();
54:     final result = plugin.processData([1, 2, 3]);
55:     
56:     expect(result, [2, 4, 6]);
57:   });
58: }
59: ```
60: 
61: ### Mocking Platform Channels in Unit Tests
62: 
63: ```dart
64: import 'package:flutter/services.dart';
65: import 'package:flutter_test/flutter_test.dart';
66: import 'package:my_plugin/my_plugin.dart';
67: 
68: void main() {
69:   TestWidgetsFlutterBinding.ensureInitialized();
70:   
71:   late MyPlugin plugin;
72:   
73:   setUp(() {
74:     // Mock platform channel
75:     TestDefaultBinaryMessengerBinding.instance.defaultBinaryMessenger
76:         .setMockMethodCallHandler(
77:       const MethodChannel('com.example.my_plugin'),
78:       (MethodCall methodCall) async {
79:         if (methodCall.method == 'getNativeValue') {
80:           return 42;
81:         }
82:         return null;
83:       },
84:     );
85:     
86:     plugin = MyPlugin();
87:   });
